{"title":"Netty中的细节优化","uid":"85e9da1b2cf2dbf50f1d6dff6091c0ed","slug":"netty/Netty 中的细节优化","date":"2025-02-12T20:02:22.000Z","updated":"2025-05-18T11:21:53.129Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/netty/Netty 中的细节优化.json","keywords":null,"cover":[],"content":"<h3 id=\"优化-jdk-原生-selector-中-IO-就绪事件的插入和遍历效率\"><a href=\"#优化-jdk-原生-selector-中-IO-就绪事件的插入和遍历效率\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"优化 jdk 原生 selector 中 IO 就绪事件的插入和遍历效率\"></a>优化 jdk 原生 selector 中 IO 就绪事件的插入和遍历效率</h3><ul>\n<li>优化代码 <code>io.netty.channel.nio.NioEventLoop#openSelector</code></li>\n<li>原生的 jdk selector 实现是 <code>sun.nio.ch.SelectorImpl</code> 其中 IO 就绪事件存放容器是<code>Set</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"/images/netty/01.png\" alt=\"netty\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>SelectedSelectionKeySet</code> 底层使用数组存储，减少了插入时的 hash 碰撞，遍历时又能利用 cpu 缓存提升效率</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"/images/netty/02.png\" alt=\"netty\"></p>\n<h3 id=\"优化客户端-channel-选择-reactor-的效率\"><a href=\"#优化客户端-channel-选择-reactor-的效率\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"优化客户端 channel 选择 reactor 的效率\"></a>优化客户端 channel 选择 reactor 的效率</h3><ul>\n<li>从 reactor 数量是 2 的倍数时使用 &amp; 运算</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"/images/netty/03.png\" alt=\"netty\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>从 reactor 数量不是 2 的倍数时使用取模运算</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"/images/netty/04.png\" alt=\"netty\"></p>\n<h3 id=\"解决-JDK-epoll-空轮训-bug\"><a href=\"#解决-JDK-epoll-空轮训-bug\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"解决 JDK epoll 空轮训 bug\"></a>解决 JDK epoll 空轮训 bug</h3><p>由于<code>JDK NIO Epoll的空轮询BUG</code>存在，这样会导致<code>Reactor线程</code>在没有任何事情可做的情况下被意外唤醒，导致 CPU 空转。</p>\n<p>其实 Netty 也没有从根本上解决这个<code>JDK BUG</code>，而是选择巧妙的绕过这个<code>BUG</code></p>\n<p><img src=\"/images/netty/05.png\" alt=\"netty\"></p>\n<h3 id=\"对象池的设计\"><a href=\"#对象池的设计\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"对象池的设计\"></a>对象池的设计</h3><ul>\n<li>stack 是对象池中真正用来存储池化对象的地方；为了避免这种不必要的同步竞争，Netty 也采用了类似 TLAB 分配内存的方式，每个线程拥有一个独立 Stack，这样当多个线程并发从对象池中获取对象时，都是从自己线程中的 Stack 中获取，全程无锁化运行。大大提高了多线程从对象池中获取对象的效率</li>\n</ul>\n","text":"优化 jdk 原生 selector 中 IO 就绪事件的插入和遍历效率 优化代码 io.netty.channel.nio.NioEventLoop#open...","permalink":"/post/netty/Netty 中的细节优化","photos":[],"count_time":{"symbolsCount":613,"symbolsTime":"1 mins."},"categories":[{"name":"Netty","slug":"Netty","count":5,"path":"api/categories/Netty.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"Netty","slug":"Netty","count":5,"path":"api/tags/Netty.json"},{"name":"源码解析","slug":"源码解析","count":5,"path":"api/tags/源码解析.json"}],"toc":"<ol class=\"toc\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E4%BC%98%E5%8C%96-jdk-%E5%8E%9F%E7%94%9F-selector-%E4%B8%AD-IO-%E5%B0%B1%E7%BB%AA%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%E7%9A%84%E6%8F%92%E5%85%A5%E5%92%8C%E9%81%8D%E5%8E%86%E6%95%88%E7%8E%87\"><span class=\"toc-text\">优化 jdk 原生 selector 中 IO 就绪事件的插入和遍历效率</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E4%BC%98%E5%8C%96%E5%AE%A2%E6%88%B7%E7%AB%AF-channel-%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9-reactor-%E7%9A%84%E6%95%88%E7%8E%87\"><span class=\"toc-text\">优化客户端 channel 选择 reactor 的效率</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3-JDK-epoll-%E7%A9%BA%E8%BD%AE%E8%AE%AD-bug\"><span class=\"toc-text\">解决 JDK epoll 空轮训 bug</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%E6%B1%A0%E7%9A%84%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1\"><span class=\"toc-text\">对象池的设计</span></a></li></ol>","author":{"name":"WU LEI","slug":"blog-author","avatar":"/images/avatar.jpg","link":"/","description":"Code & Life <br> 道阻且长，行则将至","socials":{"github":"https://github.com/taeyang0126","twitter":"","stackoverflow":"","wechat":"","qq":"","weibo":"","zhihu":"","csdn":"","juejin":"","customs":{}}},"mapped":true,"hidden":false,"prev_post":{"title":"接口安全","uid":"72cf3ebdc2a6b34952e70ed00bff2340","slug":"安全/接口安全","date":"2025-02-12T21:01:22.000Z","updated":"2025-05-18T11:21:53.129Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/安全/接口安全.json","keywords":null,"cover":[],"text":" 前后端安全性页面与接口设计 防刷机制 前后端安全性页面与接口设计接口安全密钥交换 分为 web/wap（轻客户端），android/ios（受信任客户端） 两...","permalink":"/post/安全/接